function fetchJson(url){return fetch(url).then(r=>{if(!r.ok)throw Error(`1940s 海岸 V4 资料读取失败 (${r.status})`);return r.json();});}
function currentPatchId(){return document.getElementById('location')?.value||document.getElementById('terrain')?.dataset.patch||'';}
function utm51(lonDeg,latDeg){const a=6378137,f=1/298.257223563,e2=f*(2-f),ep2=e2/(1-e2),k0=.9996,lon0=123*Math.PI/180,lat=latDeg*Math.PI/180,lon=lonDeg*Math.PI/180,s=Math.sin(lat),c=Math.cos(lat),t=Math.tan(lat),N=a/Math.sqrt(1-e2*s*s),T=t*t,C=ep2*c*c,A=c*(lon-lon0),e4=e2*e2,e6=e4*e2;const M=a*((1-e2/4-3*e4/64-5*e6/256)*lat-(3*e2/8+3*e4/32+45*e6/1024)*Math.sin(2*lat)+(15*e4/256+45*e6/1024)*Math.sin(4*lat)-(35*e6/3072)*Math.sin(6*lat));return[500000+k0*N*(A+(1-T+C)*A**3/6+(5-18*T+T*T+72*C-58*ep2)*A**5/120),k0*(M+N*t*(A*A/2+(5-T+9*C+4*C*C)*A**4/24+(61-58*T+T*T+600*C-330*ep2)*A**6/720))];}
function featurePolygons(geo){const out=[];for(const f of geo.features||[]){const g=f.geometry;if(!g)continue;if(g.type==='Polygon')out.push({coordinates:g.coordinates||[],properties:f.properties||{}});else if(g.type==='MultiPolygon')for(const p of g.coordinates||[])out.push({coordinates:p,properties:f.properties||{}});}return out;}
function patchBounds(contract,patch){const t=contract.source.transform,east=col=>t[2]+t[0]*(col+.5),north=row=>t[5]+t[4]*(row+.5),e0=east(patch.columnIndices[0]),e1=east(patch.columnIndices.at(-1)),n0=north(patch.rowIndices[0]),n1=north(patch.rowIndices.at(-1));return[Math.min(e0,e1),Math.min(n0,n1),Math.max(e0,e1),Math.max(n0,n1)];}
function projectedPolygon(poly){return poly.map(ring=>ring.map(([lon,lat])=>utm51(lon,lat)));}
function polygonBounds(poly){let w=Infinity,s=Infinity,e=-Infinity,n=-Infinity;for(const ring of poly)for(const p of ring){w=Math.min(w,p[0]);s=Math.min(s,p[1]);e=Math.max(e,p[0]);n=Math.max(n,p[1]);}return[w,s,e,n];}
function boxesIntersect(a,b){return !(a[2]<b[0]||a[0]>b[2]||a[3]<b[1]||a[1]>b[3]);}
function maskSize(box){const dx=Math.max(1,box[2]-box[0]),dy=Math.max(1,box[3]-box[1]);return dx>=dy?[MASK_MAX,Math.max(512,Math.round(MASK_MAX*dy/dx))]:[Math.max(512,Math.round(MASK_MAX*dx/dy)),MASK_MAX];}
function makeCanvas(w,h,fill='#000'){const c=document.createElement('canvas');c.width=w;c.height=h;const x=c.getContext('2d',{willReadFrequently:true});x.fillStyle=fill;x.fillRect(0,0,w,h);return[c,x];}
function drawProjectedPolygon(ctx,rings,box,w,h,fill){ctx.fillStyle=fill;ctx.beginPath();for(const ring of rings){let first=true;for(const[e,n]of ring){const x=(e-box[0])/(box[2]-box[0])*w,y=(box[3]-n)/(box[3]-box[1])*h;if(first){ctx.moveTo(x,y);first=false;}else ctx.lineTo(x,y);}ctx.closePath();}ctx.fill('evenodd');}
function drawWaterPolygons(ctx,polygons,box,w,h,fill='#fff'){for(const item of polygons)drawProjectedPolygon(ctx,item.rings,box,w,h,fill);}
function touchingEdges(poly,bounds){const[w,s,e,n]=bounds,edges=new Set();for(const ring of poly)for(const[lon,lat]of ring){if(Math.abs(lon-w)<=EDGE_EPS_DEG)edges.add('west');if(Math.abs(lon-e)<=EDGE_EPS_DEG)edges.add('east');if(Math.abs(lat-s)<=EDGE_EPS_DEG)edges.add('south');if(Math.abs(lat-n)<=EDGE_EPS_DEG)edges.add('north');}return[...edges];}
function buildProjectedControls(controls,box){const polygons=[];for(const control of controls)for(const geo of control.geos)for(const source of featurePolygons(geo)){const p=projectedPolygon(source.coordinates),b=polygonBounds(p);if(!boxesIntersect(b,box))continue;polygons.push({sheet:control.sheet,rings:p,bounds:b,touchEdges:touchingEdges(source.coordinates,control.bounds),sourcePixelArea:Number(source.properties?.pixelArea||0)});}return polygons;}
function classifyControlPolygons(polygons,base,w,h,box){const full=w*h,accepted=[],rejected=[],[c,x]=makeCanvas(w,h);for(let index=0;index<polygons.length;index++){const item=polygons[index];x.clearRect(0,0,w,h);x.fillStyle='#000';x.fillRect(0,0,w,h);drawWaterPolygons(x,[item],box,w,h,'#fff');const d=x.getImageData(0,0,w,h).data;let area=0,land=0;for(let i=0;i<d.length;i+=4)if(d[i+1]>=128){area++;if(base[i+1]>=128)land++;}if(!area)continue;const coverage=area/full,landFraction=land/area,waterSupport=1-landFraction,edgeCount=item.touchEdges.length;let reason='accepted';if(edgeCount>=2&&item.sourcePixelArea>=8000&&waterSupport<.55)reason='reject-frame-connected-weak-modern-water-support';else if(coverage>=.20&&landFraction>=.42)reason='reject-very-large-mostly-modern-land';else if(coverage>=.08&&landFraction>=.62)reason='reject-large-mostly-modern-land';else if(edgeCount>=2&&coverage>=.08&&landFraction>=.50)reason='reject-frame-connected-background';const q={sheet:item.sheet,reason,coverage:+coverage.toFixed(5),landFraction:+landFraction.toFixed(5),modernWaterSupport:+waterSupport.toFixed(5),touchEdges:item.touchEdges,sourcePixelArea:item.sourcePixelArea};if(reason==='accepted')accepted.push(item);else rejected.push(q);}return{accepted,rejected};}
function terrainCoreSeeds(terrain,base,box,w,h){const seed=new Uint8Array(w*h),pos=terrain.geometry?.attributes?.position;if(!pos)return seed;const sx=terrain.scale?.x??1,sy=terrain.scale?.y??1,sz=terrain.scale?.z??1,cx=(box[0]+box[2])*.5,cn=(box[1]+box[3])*.5;for(let i=0;i<pos.count;i++){const elev=pos.getY(i)*sy*1000;if(elev<NATURAL_CORE_M)continue;const e=cx+pos.getX(i)*sx*1000,n=cn-pos.getZ(i)*sz*1000,x=Math.round((e-box[0])/(box[2]-box[0])*(w-1)),y=Math.round((box[3]-n)/(box[3]-box[1])*(h-1));if(x<0||y<0||x>=w||y>=h)continue;const p=y*w+x;if(base[p*4+1]>=128)seed[p]=1;}return seed;}
function naturalReliefProtection(terrain,base,box,w,h){const N=w*h,seed=terrainCoreSeeds(terrain,base,box,w,h),protect=new Uint8Array(N),dist=new Uint16Array(N),queue=new Int32Array(N);dist.fill(65535);let head=0,tail=0,seedPixels=0;for(let p=0;p<N;p++)if(seed[p]){seedPixels++;protect[p]=1;dist[p]=0;queue[tail++]=p;}const mpp=Math.max((box[2]-box[0])/w,(box[3]-box[1])/h),radius=Math.max(2,Math.round(NATURAL_BUFFER_M/mpp));while(head<tail){const p=queue[head++],d=dist[p];if(d>=radius)continue;const x=p%w,y=(p/w)|0;const visit=q=>{if(q<0||q>=N||dist[q]!==65535||base[q*4+1]<128)return;dist[q]=d+1;protect[q]=1;queue[tail++]=q;};if(x>0)visit(p-1);if(x+1<w)visit(p+1);if(y>0)visit(p-w);if(y+1<h)visit(p+w);}let pixels=0;for(const v of protect)pixels+=v;return{mask:protect,seedPixels,protectedPixels:pixels,radiusPx:radius,mpp};}
function forceXuanmenOpen(ctx,box,w,h){const pts=XUANMEN_CENTERLINE_WGS84.map(([lon,lat])=>utm51(lon,lat)).map(([e,n])=>[(e-box[0])/(box[2]-box[0])*w,(box[3]-n)/(box[3]-box[1])*h]);const mpp=Math.max((box[2]-box[0])/w,(box[3]-box[1])/h),lineWidth=Math.max(3,XUANMEN_WIDTH_M/mpp);ctx.save();ctx.strokeStyle='#000';ctx.lineWidth=lineWidth;ctx.lineCap='round';ctx.lineJoin='round';ctx.beginPath();pts.forEach(([x,y],i)=>i?ctx.lineTo(x,y):ctx.moveTo(x,y));ctx.stroke();ctx.restore();return lineWidth;}
function carveDongtouOpenWater(ctx,box,w,h){const rings=[DONGTOU_OPEN_WATER_WGS84.map(([lon,lat])=>utm51(lon,lat))];drawProjectedPolygon(ctx,rings,box,w,h,'#000');}
function historicalLandAt(m,box,x,z){const e=(box[0]+box[2])*.5+x*1000,n=(box[1]+box[3])*.5-z*1000,px=Math.floor((e-box[0])/(box[2]-box[0])*m.width),py=Math.floor((box[3]-n)/(box[3]-box[1])*m.height);if(px<0||py<0||px>=m.width||py>=m.height)return false;return m.landPixels[(py*m.width+px)*4+1]>=128;}
function filterOsmObject(o,m,box){const g=o.geometry,pos=g?.attributes?.position,index=g?.index;if(!pos||!index)return{removed:0,kept:0};if(!o.userData.wenzhouMapMotherBaseIndex)o.userData.wenzhouMapMotherBaseIndex=index.array.slice();const base=o.userData.wenzhouMapMotherBaseIndex,kept=[];let removed=0;for(let k=0;k+1<base.length;k+=2){const a=Number(base[k]),b=Number(base[k+1]),ax=pos.getX(a),az=pos.getZ(a),bx=pos.getX(b),bz=pos.getZ(b);if(historicalLandAt(m,box,ax,az)&&historicalLandAt(m,box,bx,bz)&&historicalLandAt(m,box,(ax+bx)*.5,(az+bz)*.5))kept.push(a,b);else removed++;}const C=base.constructor;g.setIndex(new THREE.BufferAttribute(new C(kept),1));return{removed,kept:kept.length/2};}
function applyOsmMask(scene,m,box){let roadHidden=0,buildingHidden=0,objects=0;scene.traverse(o=>{if(!o.userData?.wenzhouOsmEvidence)return;objects++;const r=filterOsmObject(o,m,box);if(o.userData.kind==='osm-road-centerline-evidence')roadHidden+=r.removed;else if(o.userData.kind==='osm-building-footprint-boundary-evidence')buildingHidden+=r.removed;});document.getElementById('show-osm-roads')?.dispatchEvent(new Event('change'));document.getElementById('show-osm-buildings')?.dispatchEvent(new Event('change'));return{objects,roadHidden,buildingHidden};}
function buildMask(terrain,polygons,box){const baseTexture=terrain.userData.wenzhouMapMotherBaseAlphaMap||terrain.material?.alphaMap;if(!baseTexture?.image)throw Error('1940s 海岸 V4 缺少基础 land mask');terrain.userData.wenzhouMapMotherBaseAlphaMap=baseTexture;const[w,h]=maskSize(box),[baseCanvas,bx]=makeCanvas(w,h),[landCanvas,lx]=makeCanvas(w,h);bx.imageSmoothingEnabled=true;bx.imageSmoothingQuality='high';bx.drawImage(baseTexture.image,0,0,w,h);const base=bx.getImageData(0,0,w,h).data,quality=classifyControlPolygons(polygons,base,w,h,box);if(!quality.accepted.length)throw Error('1940s 海岸 V4 没有通过质量门的历史水域控制');lx.imageSmoothingEnabled=true;lx.imageSmoothingQuality='high';lx.drawImage(baseCanvas,0,0,w,h);drawWaterPolygons(lx,quality.accepted,box,w,h,'#000');let beforeDongtou=lx.getImageData(0,0,w,h).data;carveDongtouOpenWater(lx,box,w,h);let carved=lx.getImageData(0,0,w,h),data=carved.data,dongtouForcedWaterPixels=0;for(let i=0;i<data.length;i+=4)if(beforeDongtou[i+1]>=128&&data[i+1]<128)dongtouForcedWaterPixels++;const relief=naturalReliefProtection(terrain,base,box,w,h);let naturalReliefRestoredPixels=0;for(let p=0;p<relief.mask.length;p++)if(relief.mask[p]){const i=p*4;if(base[i+1]>=128&&data[i+1]<128){data[i]=data[i+1]=data[i+2]=255;data[i+3]=255;naturalReliefRestoredPixels++;}}lx.putImageData(carved,0,0);const beforeXuanmen=lx.getImageData(0,0,w,h).data,xuanmenLinePx=forceXuanmenOpen(lx,box,w,h),finalImage=lx.getImageData(0,0,w,h),d=finalImage.data;let historicalWaterPixels=0,reclaimedPixels=0,xuanmenForcedWaterPixels=0;for(let i=0;i<d.length;i+=4)if(d[i+1]<128){historicalWaterPixels++;if(base[i+1]>=128)reclaimedPixels++;if(beforeXuanmen[i+1]>=128)xuanmenForcedWaterPixels++;}const[smooth,sx]=makeCanvas(w,h);sx.filter='blur(0.6px)';sx.drawImage(landCanvas,0,0);sx.filter='none';const texture=new THREE.CanvasTexture(smooth);texture.minFilter=THREE.LinearMipmapLinearFilter;texture.magFilter=THREE.LinearFilter;texture.generateMipmaps=true;texture.anisotropy=4;texture.needsUpdate=true;return{texture,landPixels:d,width:w,height:h,historicalWaterPixels,reclaimedPixels,acceptedControlPolygons:quality.accepted.length,rejectedControlPolygons:quality.rejected.length,rejectedControls:quality.rejected,naturalSeedPixels:relief.seedPixels,naturalProtectedPixels:relief.protectedPixels,naturalReliefRestoredPixels,naturalBufferRadiusPx:relief.radiusPx,naturalBufferMpp:relief.mpp,dongtouForcedWaterPixels,xuanmenForcedWaterPixels,xuanmenLinePx};}
function applyMask(scene,terrain,m){const old=terrain.userData.wenzhouMapMotherV4AlphaMap;if(old&&old!==m.texture)old.dispose?.();terrain.userData.wenzhouMapMotherV4AlphaMap=m.texture;terrain.material.alphaMap=m.texture;terrain.material.alphaTest=.30;terrain.material.alphaToCoverage=true;terrain.material.needsUpdate=true;let sea=false;scene.traverse(o=>{if(o.userData?.wenzhouSeaDemo&&o.material?.uniforms?.uLandMask){o.material.uniforms.uLandMask.value=m.texture;o.material.needsUpdate=true;sea=true;}});return sea;}
export function installHistory1942CoastRefinementV4(){if(window[FLAG])return;window[FLAG]=true;const contractPromise=fetchJson(TERRAIN_URL),controlPromise=Promise.all(CONTROLS.map(async c=>({...c,geos:await Promise.all(c.urls.map(fetchJson))})));let latest=null,active=null,token=0;window.addEventListener('wenzhou:terrain-added',e=>{const d=e.detail||{};if(d.scene?.isScene&&d.terrain?.isMesh&&d.patchId)latest=d;});window.addEventListener('wenzhou:map-mother-1940s-refined',async e=>{if(e.detail?.schema!=='wenzhou-map-mother/1940s-land-water-delta-v3')return;const patchId=e.detail?.patchId;if(!latest||latest.patchId!==patchId||currentPatchId()!==patchId)return;const local=++token,c=document.getElementById('terrain');try{const[contract,controls]=await Promise.all([contractPromise,controlPromise]);if(local!==token||currentPatchId()!==patchId)return;const patch=contract.patches.find(p=>p.id===patchId);if(!patch)throw Error(`1940s 海岸 V4 缺少 patch ${patchId}`);const box=patchBounds(contract,patch),polygons=buildProjectedControls(controls,box),position=latest.terrain.geometry?.attributes?.position,positionVersionBefore=position?.version??0,positionCountBefore=position?.count??0,m=buildMask(latest.terrain,polygons,box);if(local!==token||currentPatchId()!==patchId){m.texture.dispose();return;}const sea=applyMask(latest.scene,latest.terrain,m),positionAfter=latest.terrain.geometry?.attributes?.position,geometryPreserved=positionAfter===position&&(positionAfter?.version??0)===positionVersionBefore&&(positionAfter?.count??0)===positionCountBefore,state=window.__wenzhouMapMother1940s||{};Object.assign(state,{schema:'wenzhou-map-mother/1940s-land-water-delta-v4',coastRefinement:'historical-water-lowland-carve-natural-relief-buffer-xuanmen-open',maskWidth:m.width,maskHeight:m.height,historicalWaterPixels:m.historicalWaterPixels,reclaimedPixels:m.reclaimedPixels,acceptedControlPolygons:m.acceptedControlPolygons,rejectedControlPolygons:m.rejectedControlPolygons,rejectedControls:m.rejectedControls,islandProtectionMode:'elevation-core-buffer-not-whole-island-component',naturalCoreM:NATURAL_CORE_M,naturalBufferM:NATURAL_BUFFER_M,naturalSeedPixels:m.naturalSeedPixels,naturalProtectedPixels:m.naturalProtectedPixels,naturalReliefRestoredPixels:m.naturalReliefRestoredPixels,dongtouReclamationRollback:'derived-open-water-lowland',dongtouForcedWaterPixels:m.dongtouForcedWaterPixels,xuanmenConnectivity:'forced-open-derived-topology',xuanmenCorridorWidthM:XUANMEN_WIDTH_M,xuanmenForcedWaterPixels:m.xuanmenForcedWaterPixels,terrainGeometryPreserved:geometryPreserved,seaMaskUpdated:sea,storage:'runtime-derived-vector-plus-relief-buffer-no-epoch-dem-copy'});window.__wenzhouMapMother1940s=state;active={scene:latest.scene,m,box,patchId,state};const osm=applyOsmMask(latest.scene,m,box);state.osmHistoricalWaterMask=osm;if(c){c.dataset.history1940sRefined='true';c.dataset.history1940sRefinementVersion='v4';c.dataset.history1940sMaskWidth=String(m.width);c.dataset.history1940sMaskHeight=String(m.height);c.dataset.history1940sHistoricalWaterPixels=String(m.historicalWaterPixels);c.dataset.history1940sReclaimedPixels=String(m.reclaimedPixels);c.dataset.history1940sNaturalReliefRestoredPixels=String(m.naturalReliefRestoredPixels);c.dataset.history1940sNaturalProtectedPixels=String(m.naturalProtectedPixels);c.dataset.history1940sDongtouForcedWaterPixels=String(m.dongtouForcedWaterPixels);c.dataset.history1940sXuanmenForcedWaterPixels=String(m.xuanmenForcedWaterPixels);c.dataset.history1940sXuanmenConnectivity='open';c.dataset.history1940sTerrainGeometryPreserved=String(geometryPreserved);c.dataset.history1940sRoadSegmentsHiddenWater=String(osm.roadHidden);c.dataset.history1940sBuildingSegmentsHiddenWater=String(osm.buildingHidden);c.dataset.history1940sSeaMaskUpdated=String(sea);c.dataset.history1940sRefinementError='';}const card=document.getElementById('history-1942-card');if(card){const strong=card.querySelector('strong'),span=card.querySelector('span'),small=card.querySelector('small');if(strong)strong.textContent='1940s Map Mother · 海岸精修 V4';if(span)span.textContent=`山体高程原样保留 · 低平填海退水 ${m.reclaimedPixels.toLocaleString()} px · 玄门湾贯通`;if(small)small.textContent='不再整块保护“孤岛组件”。只保护 ≥8m 的真实山体核心及约 300m 山麓缓冲，洞头—温州之间低平现代填海按历史开阔水域回退；原 DEM 几何高度不改。';}window.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('wenzhou:map-mother-1940s-refined-v4',{detail:state}));}catch(err){if(c)c.dataset.history1940sRefinementError=String(err.message||err);console.error(err);}});const c=document.getElementById('terrain');if(c)new MutationObserver(()=>{if(!active)return;if(c.dataset.osmLoaded==='true'&&c.dataset.osmPatch===active.patchId){const osm=applyOsmMask(active.scene,active.m,active.box);active.state.osmHistoricalWaterMask=osm;c.dataset.history1940sRoadSegmentsHiddenWater=String(osm.roadHidden);c.dataset.history1940sBuildingSegmentsHiddenWater=String(osm.buildingHidden);}}).observe(c,{attributes:true,attributeFilter:['data-osm-loaded','data-osm-patch']});}
